project_description:
Integrates the "jQuery UI DateRangePicker" widget as a module. Provides a field type, form element and integration with the Better Exposed Filters module for date fields.

Uses library http://tamble.github.io/jquery-ui-daterangepicker/ .

 Features 

 Adds a new JQuery UI Date Range Picker field type. 
 Adds a form element: daterangepicker 
 Integrates with Better Exposed Filters for date fields. 
 Allows customisation of Javascript API options - e.g. Custom presetRanges. 

 Dependencies 

 jQuery UI DateRangePicker 

 Installation 

 This module uses Asset Packagist to install the Javascript dependencies. Please setup your project's composer.json to integrate with Asset Packagist.

More information: 

 https://github.com/drupal-composer/drupal-project/issues/278 
 https://www.drupal.org/project/daterangepickerwidget/issues/3385284#com… 

 Install with composer. Installing with composer will also install the required dependencies. 

